0..62 Comment "// The forgetting map the checker applies, written out. In the"
63..141 Comment "// explicit form, a model whose sorts are manifest standing where its theory\'s"
142..215 Comment "// model is asked is written as the map\'s call, `forget[sort C = A](m) at"
216..294 Comment "// Model(Counter)`, naming each sort the map puts back with its carrier as the"
295..373 Comment "// manifest type names it; the sugared form leaves the call to the checker, or"
374..452 Comment "// states the crossing by an ascription, `(m : Model(Counter))`. The run reads"
453..491 Comment "// the same application in every form."
492..494 Comment "//"
495..510 Comment "// - see: #2130"
512..589 Comment "// The counter, counting up and down modulo three, and `observe`, which reads"
590..605 Comment "// any counter."
